WEBVTT

NOTE The walkthrough's voice, said in en (§308.7). Times match the voice in how-booking-works.mp4; re-time these if the video is made again.

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.550
Booking an appointment on BwanguReservations takes under a minute.

2
00:00:05.550 --> 00:00:06.400
Here is how.

3
00:00:08.200 --> 00:00:10.150
First, find a shop near you.

4
00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:13.850
Search for what you need, or pick a place you know.

5
00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:19.250
Choose a service, pick a day, and tap a free time.

6
00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:23.500
You see what is open right now, from morning to evening.

7
00:00:27.800 --> 00:00:31.550
Hold your time with a small deposit, paid with MTN Mobile Money.

8
00:00:32.550 --> 00:00:35.200
Approve it on your phone, and you are booked.

9
00:00:39.450 --> 00:00:41.100
You get a six-digit code.

10
00:00:42.100 --> 00:00:45.050
Show it at the door, and the shop checks you in.

11
00:00:46.050 --> 00:00:48.200
No password, no printout.

12
00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:52.000
BwanguReservations.

13
00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:55.650
Your appointments, without the phone calls.
